('samsung-galaxy-a06-128gb', 'Samsung Galaxy A06 6.7" 6GB/128GB - Light Blue', 'smartphones', 145000, 139000, 118000, 55, 0.19, '/assets/products/samsung-a06.jpg', 'Samsung''s most affordable A-series phone delivers the signature One UI experience with a vibrant 6.7" display, a capable 50MP dual camera, and a 5,000mAh battery that lasts two full days. The smart choice for first-time smartphone buyers.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 118000, '/assets/products/samsung-a06.jpg', 132000, 4.5, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

