('honor-x8c', 'Honor X8c 8GB/256GB - Midnight Black', 'smartphones', 195000, 189000, 158000, 45, 0.19, '/assets/products/honor-x8c.jpg', 'Ultra-durable and undeniably stylish. The X8c features Honor''s proprietary Ultra-Bounce Anti-Drop technology rated to survive 2-meter drops, a vibrant AMOLED display, and a 108MP ultra-clear camera that captures stunning detail in any light.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 158000, '/assets/products/honor-x8c.jpg', 178000, 4.5, 1, 'Honor', 1, 1),

