('zte-blade-v70', 'ZTE Blade V70 5G 8GB/256GB - Aurora Violet', 'smartphones', 155000, 149000, 125000, 48, 0.19, '/assets/products/zte-blade-v70.jpg', '5G democratized. The Blade V70 brings lightning-fast connectivity, a large 6.8" 90Hz display, and a versatile 50MP AI triple camera to an accessible price point, proving that next-gen technology belongs to everyone.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 125000, '/assets/products/zte-blade-v70.jpg', 142000, 4.3, 0, 'ZTE', 1, 1),

